<title>USA: TABLE-ANALYSTS' ESTIMATES FOR U.S. GRAIN, SOY CROP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ANALYSTS' ESTIMATES FOR U.S. GRAIN, SOY CROP.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
